\newlabel{fig:q3abl}{{10}{18}{Ablations at $C=1,\sigma =0.8$. Left: training duration, with the achieved $\eps $ on the secondary axis. Right: dataset size. Both change utility and privacy at the same time, so they must be reported together}{figure.caption.19}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Membership-inference results. AUC 0.5 is random guessing. The non-private baseline barely leaks; the deliberately overfit baseline leaks more, and every DP configuration returns to chance. TPR at 10\% FPR is close to 0.10 for all models.}}{18}{table.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:q3mia}{{10}{18}{Membership-inference results. AUC 0.5 is random guessing. The non-private baseline barely leaks; the deliberately overfit baseline leaks more, and every DP configuration returns to chance. TPR at 10\% FPR is close to 0.10 for all models}{table.caption.20}{}}
